🏍️ Safe Rides, Secure Lives | CISF Promotes Road Safety

CISF, along with The Indian Army, CRPF and UP Police, participated in the BIS Manak Carnival 2026, organised by the Bureau of Indian Standards (BIS), at SRM Institute of Science and Technology, Modinagar, Ghaziabad, on the occasion of World Standards Day 2026.

Shri B. L. Verma, Hon’ble Minister of State for Consumer Affairs, Food and Public Distribution and Social Justice and Empowerment, graced the occasion as the Chief Guest. The event featured a Rider Safety Bike Rally, inauguration of a Helmet Bank and awareness activities promoting road safety, quality standards and consumer protection.

The initiative highlighted the importance of wearing ISI-marked helmets, following road safety practices and choosing quality-certified products. The participation of various security forces and police personnel underscored the importance of collective efforts in building public awareness and fostering a culture of safety and responsibility.

